{
  "spec": {
    "title": "Compatibility Standard",
    "url": "https://compat.spec.whatwg.org/"
  },
  "algorithms": [
    {
      "name": "Window/orientation",
      "href": "https://compat.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-window-orientation",
      "html": "When getting the <dfn class=\"dfn-paneled idl-code\" data-dfn-for=\"Window\" data-dfn-type=\"attribute\" data-export=\"\" id=\"dom-window-orientation\"><button class=\"dfn-panelbutton\" popovertarget=\"infopanel-for-dom-window-orientation\"><code>orientation</code></button></dfn><dialog class=\"dfn-panel\" id=\"infopanel-for-dom-window-orientation\" popover=\"hint\" data-for=\"dom-window-orientation\" aria-labelledby=\"infopaneltitle-for-dom-window-orientation\"><span id=\"infopaneltitle-for-dom-window-orientation\" style=\"display:none\">Info about the 'orientation'  reference.</span><a href=\"https://compat.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-window-orientation\" class=\"dfn-link\">#dom-window-orientation</a><b>Referenced in:</b><ul><li><a href=\"https://compat.spec.whatwg.org/#ref-for-dom-window-orientation\">4.2. window.orientation API</a> <a href=\"https://compat.spec.whatwg.org/#ref-for-dom-window-orientation%E2%91%A0\">(2)</a> <a href=\"https://compat.spec.whatwg.org/#ref-for-dom-window-orientation%E2%91%A1\">(3)</a> </li><li><a href=\"https://compat.spec.whatwg.org/#ref-for-dom-window-orientation%E2%91%A2\">4.2.1. window.orientation angle</a> <a href=\"https://compat.spec.whatwg.org/#ref-for-dom-window-orientation%E2%91%A3\">(2)</a> <a href=\"https://compat.spec.whatwg.org/#ref-for-dom-window-orientation%E2%91%A4\">(3)</a> </li></ul><b>Possible linking syntaxes:</b><ul><li><div class=\"link-item\"><button class=\"copy-icon\" title=\"Copy\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></button><span>{{Window/orientation}}</span></div></li></ul></dialog> attribute, the user agent must run\nthe following steps:",
      "rationale": "let",
      "steps": [
        {
          "html": "<p>Let <var>document</var> be <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this\" id=\"ref-for-this\">this</a>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#concept-relevant-global\" id=\"ref-for-concept-relevant-global\">relevant global object</a>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/nav-history-apis.html#concept-document-window\" id=\"ref-for-concept-document-window\">associated Document</a>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>Return <var>document</var>’s current <a href=\"https://compat.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-window-orientation-angle\"><code>window.orientation</code> angle</a>.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "html": "Whenever the viewport is drawn at a different angle compared to the device’s natural orientation,\nthe user agent must run the following steps:",
      "rationale": "fire",
      "steps": [
        {
          "html": "<p><a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event-fire\" id=\"ref-for-concept-event-fire\">Fire an event</a> named\n <code><dfn class=\"dfn-paneled\" data-dfn-type=\"dfn\" data-noexport=\"\" id=\"event-orientationchange\"><button class=\"dfn-panelbutton\" popovertarget=\"infopanel-for-event-orientationchange\">orientationchange</button></dfn><dialog class=\"dfn-panel\" id=\"infopanel-for-event-orientationchange\" popover=\"hint\" data-for=\"event-orientationchange\" aria-labelledby=\"infopaneltitle-for-event-orientationchange\"><span id=\"infopaneltitle-for-event-orientationchange\" style=\"display:none\">Info about the 'orientationchange'  reference.</span><a href=\"https://compat.spec.whatwg.org/#event-orientationchange\" class=\"dfn-link\">#event-orientationchange</a><b>Referenced in:</b><ul><li><a href=\"https://compat.spec.whatwg.org/#ref-for-event-orientationchange\">4.2. window.orientation API</a> </li><li><a href=\"https://compat.spec.whatwg.org/#ref-for-event-orientationchange%E2%91%A0\">4.2.2. Event Handlers on Window objects and body elements</a> </li></ul><b>Possible linking syntaxes:</b><ul><li><div class=\"link-item\"><button class=\"copy-icon\" title=\"Copy\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></button><span>[=orientationchange=]</span></div></li><li><div class=\"link-item\"><button class=\"copy-icon\" title=\"Copy\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></button><span>[=/orientationchange=]</span></div></li></ul></dialog></code> at the\n <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/nav-history-apis.html#window\" id=\"ref-for-window①\">Window</a></code> object of the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/document-sequences.html#nav-document\" id=\"ref-for-nav-document\">active document</a>.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "html": "In order to determine the current <a class=\"idl-code\" data-link-type=\"attribute\" href=\"https://compat.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-window-orientation\" id=\"ref-for-dom-window-orientation⑤\"><code>window.orientation</code></a>\nangle, the user agent must run the following steps:",
      "rationale": "let",
      "steps": [
        {
          "html": "Let <var>orientationAngle</var> be the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/screen-orientation/#dfn-current-orientation-angle\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-current-orientation-angle\">current orientation angle</a>.",
          "rationale": "if",
          "steps": [
            {
              "html": "If <var>orientationAngle</var> is less than 180, return <var>orientationAngle</var>."
            },
            {
              "html": "If <var>orientationAngle</var> is 180, and the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#user-agent\" id=\"ref-for-user-agent\">user agent</a> supports that value, return\n          <var>orientationAngle</var>, else return 0."
            },
            {
              "html": "If <var>orientationAngle</var> is greater than 180, return <var>orientationAngle</var> - 360."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}